path of exile's newly announced update  brings new items and end game challenges  for long time players here's the four  biggest changes you need to know about  the biggest addition is the prophecy  challenge league you'll find and give  silver coins tuna volley a new hub  character allowing you to unlock new  prophecies the prophecies act as  modifiers adding guaranteed missions and  events to the generated areas of the  game such as a deadly Foss duo or a  deadly swarm of rats new rewards will be  given upon completion since you picked  the prophecy you'll know exactly what  you're getting yourself into giving you  the opportunity to prep your equipment  and abilities and don't think that will  make it easy these quests will be much  more difficult you can even change  together to create a series of  challenging quests with other own themes  and motifs this update also adds trading  between players not only allowing the  trading of items but the prophecies  themselves you can only have several  prophecies available at once so now you  can give your unwanted quests to other  players allotting slots for the  prophecies you actually want to take on  there's also one more labyrinth  challenge area being added for  high-level players it will feature  shifting environments hazardous traps  and plenty of enemies making it the most  difficult of the challenge dungeons yet  finally grinding gear is opening up to  more slots for ascendancy abilities that  means players can unlock eight of the  twelve abilities in any of the upgrade  trees granting you even more powerful  abilities for your character in addition  all that stuff you get a few minor  improvements like reduced loading times  and interface tweaks the things you  should expect from grinding gear you can  try this update out for yourself on june  third and for all your path of Exile  news stay tuned to gamespot  you  you
 

